### 🚀 第五关：技术债务监控检查 (基线控制)

#### 检查项目
```bash
echo "🔍 第五关：技术债务监控检查..."

# 1. 统计代码复杂度
COMPLEX_FILES=$(find src/ -name "*.ts" -o -name "*.vue" 2>/dev/null | \
    xargs wc -l 2>/dev/null | awk '$1 > 200 {count++} END {print count+0}')

# 2. 统计技术债务标记
TODO_COUNT=$(grep -r "TODO\|FIXME\|XXX" src/ 2>/dev/null | wc -l)

# 3. 统计代码行数变化
LINES_ADDED=$(git diff --numstat 2>/dev/null | awk '{add+=$1} END {print add+0}')
LINES_DELETED=$(git diff --numstat 2>/dev/null | awk '{del+=$2} END {print del+0}')

# 4. 计算质量评分
QUALITY_SCORE=100
[ $AS_ANY_COUNT -gt 5 ] && QUALITY_SCORE=$((QUALITY_SCORE - 10))
[ $TS_IGNORE_COUNT -gt 3 ] && QUALITY_SCORE=$((QUALITY_SCORE - 15))
[ $COMPLEX_FILES -gt 10 ] && QUALITY_SCORE=$((QUALITY_SCORE - 5))
[ $TODO_COUNT -gt 20 ] && QUALITY_SCORE=$((QUALITY_SCORE - 5))

echo "📊 技术债务监控报告:"
echo "   • 超过200行的文件数: ${COMPLEX_FILES}个"
echo "   • TODO标记数: ${TODO_COUNT}个"
echo "   • 新增代码行数: ${LINES_ADDED}行"
echo "   • 删除代码行数: ${LINES_DELETED}行"
echo "   • 质量评分: ${QUALITY_SCORE}/100"

if [ $QUALITY_SCORE -ge 85 ]; then
    echo "✅ 第五关：技术债务监控检查通过 (评分≥85)"
else
    echo "⚠️ 第五关：技术债务监控警告 (评分<85)"
    echo "💡 建议优化技术债务，但不阻止提交"
fi
```

#### 失败处理
- ⚠️ **评分<85时警告，但不阻止**
- 📊 **记录技术债务基线变化**
- 💡 **提供优化建议**
- ✅ **允许继续Git同步**

